{
    "title": "Block City Wars: Vice World 3d",
    "description": "Welcome to the Mafia World of Block City Wars! It's a modern blocky arena where fast cars, sniper duels, and wild bandit fights are the norms. Enjoy one of the best car shooting games out there! Keep your eyes peeled; shootings are rampant, and the streets nearly lawless. Discover a lot of intriguing missions involving gangsters and cops, gangs, mafia, and police. Race to outsmart other hunters for coins, weapons, and ammo scattered throughout.\r\n\r\nCreative ways of fun and action - that block city might need a little destruction to shake things up. For fans of intense 3D battlegrounds, we\u2019ve packed in everything: plasma guns, destroyers, super rifles, various armor types, and many more exhilarating items for you to discover!\r\n\r\nAccomplish impossible ops where you're the key to achieving critical goals. Drive awesome cars and escape from rival gangs. Whether you choose to be a hero or a bad guy, adventures are waiting at every corner. Arm yourself with your pixel gun and head into the Block City!\r\n\r\nWelcome to 3d shooter - Block City Wars:\r\n\u22b9 1,000,000+ players worldwide for thrilling online gaming!\r\n\u22b9 A vast open world with towering skyscrapers where you are free to do whatever you wish.\r\n\u22b9 Cool multiplayer Free PVP Fight mode and a captivating single-player Campaign.\r\n\u22b9 More than 20 modes of transport, including sports cars, motorcycles, jet packs, zip lines, and gliders \u2013 all customizable\r\n\u22b9 Arm yourself for combat with over 30 weapon units \u2013 from the AK47 and MINIGUN to sniper rifles, RPGs, Katanas, and many more!\r\n\u22b9 Wide range of mods to upgrade your guns: silencers, extended magazines, improved sights, stocks, and much more!\r\n\u22b9 Full game stats and daily winners lists.\r\n\u22b9 A community of more than 150,000 players online every day.\r\n\u22b9 Game chat to communicate with fellow players.\r\n\u22b9 Awesome pixel graphics with dynamic lighting.\r\n\u22b9 Endless character customization possibilities, featuring various skins and cosmetics.\r\n\r\nDon\u2019t miss out on this fun car shooting game! Enter the amazing blocky world of Block City Wars and become a survivor in a city controlled by the mafia!\r\n\r\nFollow us on social media:\r\n\r\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/bcw3D\r\nDiscord: https://discord.gg/blockcitywars2\r\nInsta: https://www.instagram.com/bcw_pg/",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to the Mafia World of Block City Wars! It&#39;s a modern blocky arena where fast cars, sniper duels, and wild bandit fights are the norms. Enjoy one of the best car shooting games out there! Keep your eyes peeled; shootings are rampant, and the streets nearly lawless. Discover a lot of intriguing missions involving gangsters and cops, gangs, mafia, and police. Race to outsmart other hunters for coins, weapons, and ammo scattered throughout.<br><br>Creative ways of fun and action - that block city might need a little destruction to shake things up. For fans of intense 3D battlegrounds, we\u2019ve packed in everything: plasma guns, destroyers, super rifles, various armor types, and many more exhilarating items for you to discover!<br><br>Accomplish impossible ops where you&#39;re the key to achieving critical goals. Drive awesome cars and escape from rival gangs. Whether you choose to be a hero or a bad guy, adventures are waiting at every corner. Arm yourself with your pixel gun and head into the Block City!<br><br>Welcome to 3d shooter - Block City Wars:<br>\u22b9 1,000,000+ players worldwide for thrilling online gaming!<br>\u22b9 A vast open world with towering skyscrapers where you are free to do whatever you wish.<br>\u22b9 Cool multiplayer Free PVP Fight mode and a captivating single-player Campaign.<br>\u22b9 More than 20 modes of transport, including sports cars, motorcycles, jet packs, zip lines, and gliders \u2013 all customizable<br>\u22b9 Arm yourself for combat with over 30 weapon units \u2013 from the AK47 and MINIGUN to sniper rifles, RPGs, Katanas, and many more!<br>\u22b9 Wide range of mods to upgrade your guns: silencers, extended magazines, improved sights, stocks, and much more!<br>\u22b9 Full game stats and daily winners lists.<br>\u22b9 A community of more than 150,000 players online every day.<br>\u22b9 Game chat to communicate with fellow players.<br>\u22b9 Awesome pixel graphics with dynamic lighting.<br>\u22b9 Endless character customization possibilities, featuring various skins and cosmetics.<br><br>Don\u2019t miss out on this fun car shooting game! Enter the amazing blocky world of Block City Wars and become a survivor in a city controlled by the mafia!<br><br>Follow us on social media:<br><br>Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/bcw3D<br>Discord: https://discord.gg/blockcitywars2<br>Insta: https://www.instagram.com/bcw_pg/",
